# Panel 218's R2, item 1, 2026-10-17, lane land215 (found by its completeness
# critic: a probe that did not link passed in silence, and a header whose
# constructor called zlib built `INT_MIN / -1` at exit 0, a new value per run).
#
# A probe that does not link with the runtime alone is told with the linker's
# words and the header's code named, never counted judged: this header's
# constructor calls a function no library of the probe holds, so the link
# leaves it undefined and the constant the probe asked is told so.

extern "fixedbugs-2075-unlinked.h"
    constant U_VALUE: i32  #~ ffi_constant_type

function main()
    print(U_VALUE)
